# Vide-Coder Workflow (Cursor entry-point)

The single source of truth: [`.agent/rules/00-ai-workflow.md`](../../.agent/rules/00-ai-workflow.md).
This file is only a pointer — always read the source rule before working.

## MANDATORY
- Read & follow all 11 steps: Discovery → Impact → Architecture → Specification → Planning →
  Task Breakdown → Implementation → Self Validation → AI Review → Human Review → Knowledge Update.
- **Do not skip** Discovery, Impact Analysis, Self-Validation.
- Each task = its own Git Worktree.
- Branch `feature|fix|refactor|hotfix/PROJECT-XXX-desc`; commit Conventional Commits + Jira ID.
- Before considering it Done: see `docs/DEFINITION-OF-DONE.md`.

## Mandatory rule documents to read
- `.agent/rules/01-code-style.md`
